  "prompt": "For the users who signed up from October to December 2025, what share of each signup cohort paid in each of its first four months? A user's cohort month is the month of signup_ts, in UTC, and a user counts as paying in a month with at least one payment that was not refunded, by the UTC month of paid_at. The month offset counts calendar months from the cohort month, from 0 to 3. The as-of date is 5 January 2026: a month that ends after it is not known yet and its share shows missing, while a month that has ended with no paying user shows 0. Return three columns, in this order: cohort_month (the first day of the month), month_offset and paying_share, the paying users divided by all the users who signed up that month, as a fraction between 0 and 1. Return one row for each cohort month and each month offset from 0 to 3. Any row order is fine.",
